{
  "_": [
    "Masks for MM7 bitmaps and icons whose zeroIsTransparent flag is wrong. An image that is not listed follows the flag: palette entry #0 is transparent if the flag is set, and nothing is transparent otherwise.",
    "Values:",
    "\"default\" follows the flag, the same as not listing the image.",
    "\"none\" makes nothing transparent, even if the flag is set.",
    "\"zero\" makes palette entry #0 transparent, even if the flag is not set.",
    "\"#rrggbb\" makes every palette entry of that color transparent, whatever the flag says. In a PCX image, every pixel of that color."
